7. Whether the GitHub CLI maintainers will provide support or fixes for community-packaged versions (despite the "do not maintain" statement) in any circumstances is UNKNOWN.
8. Whether the presence of install commands for many package managers implies an endorsement of any single package manager as the primary method is UNKNOWN.

